window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Tragedy strikes, and Echo, one of Aria's fiercest Elites, finds herself facing unimaginable loss.</b></p> <p>In true Elite fashion, she doesn't take it lying down. Setting out on a journey for retribution and retaliation, Echo discovers new bonds and hidden truths about her own identity.</p> <p>The Elites are done waiting for the next blow. It's time to strike back! How far is Echo willing to go? And what will happen when those they're up against decide to strike back?</p> <p><i>For mature listeners.</i></p>"; 
